      "source_tier": 1,
      "title": "hoshimachi suisei (casual)",
      "excerpt": "The 3rd [[official alternate costume|costume]] of [[hololive]]'s [[Hoshimachi Suisei]], debuted on 2020-11-12.\r\n\r\nIt consists of a [[black hat|black]] [[quilted headwear|quilted]] [[beret]], a [[short dress|short]] [[collared dress|collared]] [[black dress]] (sometimes depicted as a [[skirt set]]) with [[short sleeves|short]] [[lace sleeves]], a pair of [[bow earrings]], a [[black choker|black]] [[lace choker]], a [[neck ribbon]], a [[blue jacket|dark blue]] [[long sleeves|long-sleeved]] [[two-sided jacket|two-sided]] [[quilted jacket]], a [[black belt]] with her name on it, an [[orange pantyhose]] with an [[o-ring thigh strap]] attached to a [[single garter strap]], and a pair of [[black boots|black]] [[high heel boots|high-heel]] [[lace-up boots]].\r\n\r\nHer [[official alternate hairstyle|official hairstyle]] with this attire is [[long hair]] [[colored inner hair]] with [[swept bangs]] and a [[one side up]] with a [[green ribbon|green]] [[hair ribbon]].\r\n\r\nh4. Appearance\r\n\r\n* !post #6271385: Profile\r\n* !post #5797750: Merchandise",
      "captured_at": "2026-08-31"
    },
    {
      "id": "gelbooru:wiki:hoshimachi_suisei_(casual)",
      "source_site": "gelbooru",
      "source_kind": "wiki",
      "source_key": "hoshimachi_suisei_(casual)",
      "source_url": "https://gelbooru.com/index.php?page=wiki&s=view&id=hoshimachi_suisei_(casual)",
      "source_tier": 1,
      "title": "hoshimachi suisei (casual)",
      "excerpt": "The 3rd [[official alternate costume|costume]] of [[Hololive]]'s [[Hoshimachi Suisei]], as seen in post #5797750, debuted on 2020-11-12.\r\n\r\nIt consists of a [[black hat|black]] [[quilted headwear|quilted]] [[beret]], a [[short dress|short]] [[collared dress|collared]] [[black dress]] (sometimes depicted as a [[skirt set]]) with [[short sleeves|short]] [[lace]] [[lace sleeves|sleeves]], a pair of [[bow earrings]], a [[black choker|black]] [[lace choker]], a [[neck ribbon]], a [[blue jacket|dark blue]] [[long sleeves|long-sleeved]] [[two-sided jacket|two-sided]] [[quilted jacket]], a [[black belt]] with her name on it, an [[orange pantyhose]] with an [[o-ring thigh strap]] attached to a [[single garter strap]], and a pair of [[black footwear|black]] [[high heel boots|high-heel]] [[lace-up boots]].\r\n\r\nHer [[official alternate hairstyle|official hairstyle]] with this attire is [[long hair]] [[colored inner hair]] with [[swept bangs]] and a [[one side up]] with a [[green ribbon|green]] [[hair ribbon]].",
      "captured_at": "2026-08-31"
    }
  ],
